  "contract": "Appendix B library forms and semantics, extended with finite relational modes and documented/common formal errors; no exhaustive ISO certification.",
  "source": "lib_eq1(X).\nlib_eq2(X,X).\nlib_eq3(X,X,X).\nlib_eq4(X,X,X,X).\nlib_eq5(X,X,X,X,X).\nlib_eq6(X,X,X,X,X,X).\nlib_eq7(X,X,X,X,X,X,X).\nlib_choice(a,1). lib_choice(a,2). lib_choice(b,3).\nlib_fold(A,S,T):-T is S+A.\nlib_fold2(A,B,S,T):-T is S+A+B.\nlib_fold3(A,B,C,S,T):-T is S+A+B+C.\nlib_fold_choice(X,S,T):-member(T,[X,S]).\nlib_throw(X):-throw(X).\nlib_args1(a1).\nlib_args1(b1).\nlib_args2(a1,a2).\nlib_args2(b1,b2).\nlib_args3(a1,a2,a3).\nlib_args3(b1,b2,b3).\nlib_args4(a1,a2,a3,a4).\nlib_args4(b1,b2,b3,b4).\nlib_args5(a1,a2,a3,a4,a5).\nlib_args5(b1,b2,b3,b4,b5).\nlib_args6(a1,a2,a3,a4,a5,a6).\nlib_args6(b1,b2,b3,b4,b5,b6).\nlib_args7(a1,a2,a3,a4,a5,a6,a7).\nlib_args7(b1,b2,b3,b4,b5,b6,b7).\nlib_record(A,S,step(A,S)). lib_record2(A,B,S,step(A,B,S)). lib_record3(A,B,C,S,step(A,B,C,S)).\n",
  "cases": [
